From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mutter: include the Gnoblin test fragment

The Gnoblin settings tests are overlay files, src/tests/*-gnoblin-settings-test.c, and their test_cases entries are
the overlay fragment src/tests/gnoblin-tests/meson.build. This patch is the upstream side: include the fragment
before Mutter builds the test executables from test_cases.
---
 src/tests/meson.build | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/tests/meson.build b/src/tests/meson.build
index a58ddacf..262c952f 100644
--- a/src/tests/meson.build
+++ b/src/tests/meson.build
@@ -1291,6 +1291,8 @@ test_cases += [
   },
 ]
 
+subdir('gnoblin-tests')
+
 foreach test_case: test_cases
   test_executable = executable('mutter-' + test_case['name'],
     sources: test_case['sources'],
-- 
2.55.0

